  "ProcessConfigFilterHover": "Data will be imported based on the values entered here. Regular expressions can be used.\nFor example, use\n\"\"   “abc” to search for items containing “abc” (partial match),\n   “^abc” to find items starting with “abc”,\n   “^abc$” for items matching “abc” (exact match),\n   “ab|c” to search for items containing either “ab” or “c” (OR condition), and\n   “^(?!test|abc).*” to find items starting something other than “test” or “abc”.\n(“^” indicates that the next character is at the beginning, “$” indicates that the preceding character is at the end, and “|” means OR.\nNote: The quotation marks are not needed when entering the values.)",
  "HoverConversationFormulaMsg": "Enter the unit. It will be displayed in the plot area, etc. Only units defined in the system can be registered.\nIf the DataType is a judgment, the conversion formula Pos~p0|Neg=p1|n1 will be displayed.\np0 is the original data value of the positive example judge value, p1 and n1 are the display values for the positive and negative examples, respectively (e.g., OK and NG for products).",
